      "content": "hey, i'm having a bit of a bug with this vba macro i wrote for our monthly reconciliation. i keep running into a \"run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error\" right when it tries to copy the data over. \n\neverything seemed to work fine yesterday, so i'm not sure why it's hitting this error now. can you help me look at the code?\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Reconciliation_Report\")\n    \n    ws.Range(\"A1:Z100\").ClearContents\n    \n    Dim lastRow As Long\n    lastRow = ws.Cells(ws.Rows.Count, \"A\").End(xlUp).Row\n    \n    ws.Range(\"A2:Z\" & lastRow).Value = Sheets(\"Data_Dump\").Range(\"A2:Z\" & lastRow).Value\n    \n    MsgBox \"Report generated successfully\"\nEnd Sub",
